changes.old_desc:
Salary statistics (25th/50th/75th percentile, sample size) from active vacancies on Finder.
country: ISO code; profession: name in local language (e.g. 'Бухгалтер', 'Programmierer'); empty = all jobs;
city optional. Returns the matching Finder salary page url when available.

